      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\">Within one calendar year, <code>year</code> is that exact integer. Truncations stay\ninside the window's range (rounded down), <code>hour</code> is in <code>[0, 23]</code> (a\nproved range, not monotone). Without the filter, Lean warns that\ntruncating to a month <strong>may fail</strong>: DataFusion can't truncate timestamps\nnear the ends of its range (chapter 6 shows how such warnings work).</span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
