            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"text\">Text</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Strings are sequences of Unicode characters in the model.\n<code>substring</code>, <code>strpos</code>, <code>character_length</code>, <code>trim</code>, <code>||</code> and <code>LIKE</code> are\ncomputed exactly, and the test suite checks them against DataFusion on\nrandom strings. Here is Lean's <code>Rel.eval</code> next to DataFusion on some\nawkward words:</span></span>"
